  <main class="detail-main" id="main" tabindex="-1"><div class="detail-hero"><div class="wrap detail-hero-inner"><nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><a href="/journal/">Journal</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span aria-current="page">What a dental scan can help you see</span></nav><p class="eyebrow">Technology · 3 min read</p><h1>What a dental scan can help you see</h1><p class="detail-lead">Seeing what the dentist sees can make a treatment discussion more concrete. The first question to ask is what the image is for.</p></div></div><div class="wrap detail-grid"><article class="detail-card prose"><p class="editorial-note" data-editorial-review>Staging only — this article is hidden from the public site until clinically approved in the Raina Website settings.</p><section><h2>Match the image to the question</h2><p>An optical impression records the shape of visible teeth and gums. A dental X-ray can reveal details that a visual exam cannot, such as some decay between teeth. Ask which tool your dentist is using and what decision it will help inform.</p></section><section><h2>Ask the dentist to show you the finding</h2><p>You can ask the dentist to point out the area of interest and explain what the image shows alongside what they found in your mouth. If there is an earlier image, ask whether the comparison changes the plan.</p></section><section><h2>Find out what happens next</h2><p>Ask whether the image is being used to document a baseline, plan a procedure or investigate a concern. The answer can help you understand the timing of the next visit and what questions to bring.</p></section><h2>Further reading</h2><ul><li><a class="text-link" href="https://www.mouthhealthy.org/all-topics-a-z/x-rays">ADA MouthHealthy · Dental X-rays <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a></li></ul><a class="text-link" href="/care/technology/">See the technology showcase <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a></article><aside class="detail-aside"><span class="aside-mark" aria-hidden="true">R</span><p class="eyebrow">Raina Dental Care</p><h2>Let’s talk.</h2><p>2323 Naperville Road, Suite 110<br>Naperville, Illinois</p><a class="button" href="/care/appointments/">Schedule a visit <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a><a class="text-link" href="tel:+16303814021">Call (630) 381-4021 <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a></aside></div></main>
